V_D0 D0 0 PWL(0n 0 1n 0 8n 0 8.05n 1.8 28n 1.8 28.05n 0 48n 0 48.05n 1.8 68n 1.8 68.05n 0 88n 0 88.05n 0 108n 0 108.05n 0 128n 0 128.05n 0 188n 0 188.05n 1.8 208n 1.8 208.05n 0 228n 0 228.05n 1.8)
