V_D1 D1 0 PWL(0n 0 1n 0 8n 0 8.05n 0 28n 0 28.05n 1.8 48n 1.8 48.05n 0 68n 0 68.05n 1.8 88n 1.8 88.05n 1.8 108n 1.8 108.05n 1.8 128n 1.8 128.05n 1.8 188n 1.8 188.05n 0 208n 0 208.05n 1.8 228n 1.8 228.05n 0)
